-- Color.cm -- Gargoyle, the 1986 colour illustrator, on the colour display.-- Tim made his book's artwork in Gargoyle, so this is the tool, not a demo.-- BiScrollers is NOT handled here any more: User.Profile loads it (and its-- INTERFACE bcds, which is what Gargoyle actually imports) at boot.Echo Turning the colour display on...ColorDisplay onEcho Fetching Gargoyle. Its whole closure is already local, so this is quick.Bringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Gargoyle.dfEcho Loading Gargoyle, its packages, and the ColorTool...Source Gargoyle.loadEcho Now type  Gargoyle  to open it.